<Base title="Terms" description="Terms for using this store.">
  <div class="page-wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">Terms</p><h1>Terms of purchase.</h1><p class="lede">By placing an order, you confirm that your delivery details are accurate and that you are authorized to use the selected payment method.</p><h2>Orders and payment</h2><p>Prices and availability are confirmed by Commerce at checkout. Payment is completed through CHIP's hosted payment page. An order is accepted only after payment confirmation.</p><h2>Support</h2><p>For questions about an order, contact the store with the order ID shown after checkout.</p></div>
</Base>
